        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 21.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Feola syndon folcgerihtu .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">There are many folk rights</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[21.4] Feola syndon folcgerihtu: on sumre ðeode gebyreð winterfeorm, Easterfeorm, bendform for ripe, gytfeorm for yrðe, mæðmed, hreacmete, æt wudulade wæntreow, æt cornlade hreaccopp 7 fela ðinga, ðe ic getellan ne mæig.</ab>
